Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:12.26,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 华盛顿 WTA500 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:12.26,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs38}4-6 6-4 6-0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 佩古拉 · 赛后亚军致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, first I want to congratulate Alex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先我想恭喜伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:04.48,EN,,0,0,0,,on an amazing week,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:04.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周打得太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.00,EN,,0,0,0,,an amazing tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,整站都很出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know I I don't know how much more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道还能再说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I can say, but you're an amazing player
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你是个了不起的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and just to see how far you've come
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,看你这两年走了多远
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:13.72,EN,,0,0,0,,over the last couple years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,从我们第一次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:14.96,EN,,0,0,0,,when we first played,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:16.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to see the amazing fans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有那些球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:19.88,EN,,0,0,0,,that follow you every single place you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你走到哪儿他们跟到哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:20.84,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not fun to play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟你打起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.48,EN,,0,0,0,,against, but I do appreciate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不好受 但我真的很享受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,the really fun atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I do. I think it's amazing, so congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的 我觉得很棒 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,All the best to you and your team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你和你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and your coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你的教练一切都好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:37.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I would like to go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and thank my coach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and my hitting partner Mark and Spencer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,和陪练 马克和斯宾塞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:41.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that were here with me this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周一直陪着我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,My other coach Mark who's not here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有没来的另一位教练马克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:44.84,EN,,0,0,0,,my coach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:44.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,or my trainer John who's also not here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者说体能师约翰 他也没来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but thanks you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:50.64,EN,,0,0,0,,for continuously always putting in the work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,一周又一周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:53.40,EN,,0,0,0,,with me week after week and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直陪我一起下功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,unfortunate today, but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天有点遗憾 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,we've been playing some great tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们这阵子打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and just thanks so much for all you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们为我做的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:03.44,EN,,0,0,0,,do for me and I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I would like to thank Mubadala for putting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想谢谢穆巴达拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:13.24,EN,,0,0,0,,on this event also along with Mark, Danny,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,办了这项赛事 还有马克 丹尼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Christina, everyone else that helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,克里斯蒂娜 和所有帮忙的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:18.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I've seen you guys most of you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们中大多数人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.00,EN,,0,0,0,,since I first won this title here in 2019
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,2019 年我首次夺冠时就见过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:23.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and I love coming back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别喜欢回到这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and seeing the same volunteers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是同一批志愿者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,the same locker room attendants,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,同一批更衣室的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.00,EN,,0,0,0,,the same people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,餐厅里的服务员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:30.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in dining like it's the same people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,也还是同一批
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:31.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and you guys remember me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,而你们还记得我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:33.40,EN,,0,0,0,,from when I first came here, so I always
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:33.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,记得我第一次来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.84,EN,,0,0,0,,have the best feeling coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以每次回来都特别舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:37.96,EN,,0,0,0,,It's it's always feels super special
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次都觉得很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and so much has happened obviously
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,从我上次夺冠到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,since the last time I won this title and it still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,显然发生了很多事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:43.44,EN,,0,0,0,,feels just as special coming back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:43.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,但回来的感觉一样特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.44,0:01:45.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So everyone on the grounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.44,0:01:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以场地里的每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.80,EN,,0,0,0,,all the volunteers are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,志愿者们都太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:49.36,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys are so friendly, so nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:49.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们又友善又热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,the security, the ball kids, everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,安保 球童 每一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.32,EN,,0,0,0,,that helps put this on and I know it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮着把这项赛事办起来的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:56.64,EN,,0,0,0,,was not an easy feat to move this final
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道把决赛挪到周一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to a Monday final.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,一点都不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:01:58.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:01:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:00.44,EN,,0,0,0,,the weather yesterday was not very good
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,昨天的天气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:02.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to us, but thank you guys so much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我们不太友好 但太谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,for just for being here for an extra day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们多留了一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:06.52,EN,,0,0,0,,for putting this event on for an extra day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:06.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,多办了一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.72,EN,,0,0,0,,for working an extra day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,多上了一天班
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure hopefully you're getting paid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:13.32,EN,,0,0,0,,a little overtime for that, but everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:13.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿到了加班费 而且每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.12,EN,,0,0,0,,is here bright and early this morning ready
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天一大早就来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:18.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to go, and um I know that it was not easy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道这不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and it was a hard decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是个很难的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but thank you guys for doing what was best
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但谢谢你们做了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,for the players yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,对球员最好的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks Mark for being able to make
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢马克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:24.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,拍了这个板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and we were able to come out here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我们今天能上场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and have an amazing final.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,打了一场很棒的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:29.80,EN,,0,0,0,,And last but not least, thanks to the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后 谢谢现场的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Like Mark said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像马克说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:38.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I I can definitely confirm probably
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:38.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我可以确认
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:40.68,EN,,0,0,0,,for a Monday final, this is this is the best
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:40.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这大概是我见过最好的一届
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:43.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Monday final crowd I've I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,周一决赛观众
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I know I'm sure uh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:49.44,EN,,0,0,0,,some people took off took off work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些人是请了假的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:50.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I won't tell them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不会告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:53.40,EN,,0,0,0,,where you guys were, but um it's amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们跑哪儿去了 但你们能来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,that you guys showed up, and again even
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的太好了 还有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to to all the Filipino fans that came out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有到场的菲律宾球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:03.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and have supported Uh you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:03.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.76,EN,,0,0,0,,are still helping grow tennis around
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们在帮着网球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,the world, and I appreciate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,在全世界成长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.00,EN,,0,0,0,,that being a you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,而作为一名女运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.52,EN,,0,0,0,,a female athlete being in tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很感激这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:09.60,EN,,0,0,0,,We love to see that grow,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们特别希望看到它长大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:12.26,EN,,0,0,0,,so thanks so much everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以非常感谢大家
